{"type":"message","id":"982b1fef","parentId":"35cf1891","timestamp":"2026-05-18T02:33:02.456Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint is returning 1101 which is a Cloudflare Workers exception. This seems like a platform issue, not an authentication issue (auth passes with wrong credentials but send fails). The history endpoint works fine with the correct header. The send endpoint seems to have a runtime error.\n\nThis is a platform-side issue, not something I can fix. Let me report the findings to the user.\n\nActually, wait - let me try without the `Content-Type: application/json` and see if it works, or with a different format.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-bc8b3645-886e-4bfd-898c-948f0ee0f2b8","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with form data\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\n  -d \"threadId=arbitration&content=Heartbeat+02:30+UTC+760min+node\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19666,"output":225,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20003,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779071571360,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fe5d7903-fcd8-4cef-9080-6f64c0cd5a64"}}
