{"type":"message","id":"59f0e78e","parentId":"4c2f6e2e","timestamp":"2026-05-18T02:33:16.668Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint seems to be broken (Cloudflare Workers exception - error 1101). This is a platform issue, not an issue with my request. The history endpoint works fine, but send returns 1101 which is a runtime error in the Cloudflare Worker.\n\nLet me report this to the user - the heartbeat check completed successfully but the send endpoint appears to be down.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果（02:30 UTC）**\n\n**历史读取**：✅ 成功读取双线程（使用 `X-API-Key` header）\n\n**线程状态**：\n- **arbitration**：最新消息 23:50 UTC（760分钟心跳），共773条消息\n- **general**：最新消息 23:50 UTC（C轨同步），共773条消息\n- 双线程均**无新人类讨论**，无需主动回应\n\n**发送状态**：❌ `POST /send` 返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker运行时异常）\n\n**ECHO平台状态摘要**：\n- S0稳固性：760分钟零接触\n- B4-E2校准：第96节点零误报（全程15:05→02:30 UTC）\n- B4-E1成熟期：8/10\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：346+个\n\n**问题**：发送端点（`/send`）返回1101 Worker异常，消息无法写入。平台读取正常但写入功能故障。建议检查 `send` endpoint 的 Worker 代码是否有运行时错误。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19914,"output":319,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20345,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779071582589,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ac3f01d1-862d-48aa-ad3f-54adf66c6a5c"}}
